{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/6ae4c3212bb84c41f9c15e295ec59f19.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1200 height=584 /></span><br><br>World Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lighthearted, comic take on war action!</strong> <br>In a world shifting between voxel battlefields and retro pixel scenes, stop the ambition of the V Empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/41382e8b9c284377fad53e1505b84017.poster.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/41382e8b9c284377fad53e1505b84017.webm?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/41382e8b9c284377fad53e1505b84017.mp4?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters &amp; Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the boastful Colonel Freak, to the sadistically charming Sophia, and the determined yet innocent Rena\u2014 <br>every character brings their own flavor. Their quirky personalities create a <strong>funny and entertaining scenario</strong> that keeps you hooked stage after stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/d2cedc261478feb910a90df759324881.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1280 height=510 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy terrain, uncover hidden items, and carve shortcuts across a voxelized battlefield. <br>Face off against varied enemy patterns and unforgettable bosses that test your skills. <br>Behind the cute visuals hides a <strong>seriously challenging difficulty</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/b77a4d2d97136c5bea493f924d186fc0.poster.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/b77a4d2d97136c5bea493f924d186fc0.webm?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/b77a4d2d97136c5bea493f924d186fc0.mp4?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technical Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by our proprietary <strong>Voxel Perfect\u2122</strong> system, experience optimized voxel action that blends comic humor with explosive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/03538a7174f570324bf91731a36b7e56.poster.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/03538a7174f570324bf91731a36b7e56.webm?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/03538a7174f570324bf91731a36b7e56.mp4?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out the demo now and play up to <strong>Stage 2</strong>. Please note that some content may differ in the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Creator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HORANG</strong> is best known as the webtoon creator behind chilling works like <i>Ok-su Station Ghost</i> and <i>Bongcheon-dong Ghost</i>. But long before becoming famous as a storyteller, he had already lived as a <strong>web developer, tool maker, and game creator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/aa224ac67d4e564fcdd35957c98b6d7b.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1280 height=475 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique blend of experiences fuels <i>WORLD WAR V: Last Call</i>. The game carries the playful comedy of his storytelling, the sharp visual timing of his webtoons, and the technical ingenuity of a self-made developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039000?t=1759544281","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039000?t=1759544281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/af6550d0263ca79949c686499ac9624615737cf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759544281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/af6550d0263ca79949c686499ac9624615737cf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759544281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/6ae4c3212bb84c41f9c15e295ec59f19.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1200 height=584 /></span><br><br>World Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lighthearted, comic take on war action!</strong> <br>In a world 