c0.poster.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/b77a4d2d97136c5bea493f924d186fc0.webm?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/b77a4d2d97136c5bea493f924d186fc0.mp4?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technical Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by our proprietary <strong>Voxel Perfect\u2122</strong> system, experience optimized voxel action that blends comic humor with explosive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/03538a7174f570324bf91731a36b7e56.poster.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/03538a7174f570324bf91731a36b7e56.webm?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/03538a7174f570324bf91731a36b7e56.mp4?t=1759544281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out the demo now and play up to <strong>Stage 2</strong>. Please note that some content may differ in the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Creator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HORANG</strong> is best known as the webtoon creator behind chilling works like <i>Ok-su Station Ghost</i> and <i>Bongcheon-dong Ghost</i>. But long before becoming famous as a storyteller, he had already lived as a <strong>web developer, tool maker, and game creator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/extras/aa224ac67d4e564fcdd35957c98b6d7b.avif?t=1759544281\" width=1280 height=475 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique blend of experiences fuels <i>WORLD WAR V: Last Call</i>. The game carries the playful comedy of his storytelling, the sharp visual timing of his webtoons, and the technical ingenuity of a self-made developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Studio HORANG"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4031300","name":"WORLD WAR V: LAST CALL"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039000/3ef4c326ae7dd3e76c7484a9da66db1ca97ea60d/header.jpg?t=1759544281","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4039000/540239345/88114afc3b1d2e30ed1a97b63822d9ddadaa8062/1758000513/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759112285","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4039000/540239345/88114afc3b1d2e30ed1a97b63822d9ddadaa8062/1758000513/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759112285","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4039000/540239345/88114afc3b1d2e30ed1a97b63822d9ddadaa8062/1758000513/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759112285","id":257198498,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198498/movie480.mp4?t=1759112285","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198498/movie_max.mp4?t=1759112285"},"name":"WORLD WAR V: LAST CALL Game Play English","thumbnail":"h